.TH TABBED 1 tabbed-VERSION
.SH NAME
tabbed \- minimal reparenting tabbed container for X11 windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tabbed
.I window-id-1
[
.I window-id-2
]
...
[
.B \-v
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tabbed
creates a simple container window with tabs at the top, and reparents the specified X11 window IDs inside it.
.PP
Tabs show the window titles, which update in real time. Resizing the tabbed window resizes the active client window.
.PP
If all client windows are closed/destroyed,
.B tabbed
exits gracefully.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Alt + [1..9]
Select a specific tab directly.
.TP
.B Alt + Left / Alt + Right
Cycle to the previous or next tab.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v
Display version information and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success, non-zero on error.
